---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Klyn — Suministros para Instituciones Educativas"
  description="Limpieza, papelería e insumos para escuelas, preparatorias y universidades. Cotiza en minutos y recibe en todo México."
  bodyClass=""
>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #ffffff;
      --surface: #f5f9ff;
      --fg: #161c2d;
      --muted: #869ab8;
      --border: #dbdbdb;
      --accent: #335eea;
      --accent-secondary: #6cace3;
      --radius: 16px;
    }

    .section-pad { padding: 5rem 0; }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .section-desc {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      max-width: 640px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .hero-landing {
      min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      background: linear-gradient(150deg, #0d2341 0%, #1e4a7c 55%, #6cace3 100%);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-landing::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 30px 30px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 3rem;
      width: 100%;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      padding: 6rem 24px 5rem;
    }

    .hero-text {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 580px;
    }

    .hero-image-frame {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: min(380px, 38vw);
      aspect-ratio: 1/1;
    }

    .hero-image-placeholder {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .hero-image-placeholder svg {
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow-landing {
      display: inline-block;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-landing h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6.5vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      line-height: 1.04;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .hero-landing p {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      max-width: 640px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn-landing-primary {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--accent);
      border: none;
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-landing-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }

    .btn-landing-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-landing-secondary:hover {
      border-color: #fff;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .benefits-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .benefit-card {
      background: var(--bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    }

    .benefit-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .benefit-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .benefit-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--surface);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .why-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .why-card {
      background: var(--bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }

    .why-card h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .why-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .why-icon {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--surface);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .testimonials-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .testimonial-card {
      background: var(--bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      position: relative;
    }

    .testimonial-card::before {
      content: '"';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0.75rem;
      left: 1.25rem;
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--accent-secondary);
      opacity: 0.3;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .testimonial-text {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--fg);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      padding-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .testimonial-author {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .testimonial-avatar {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--surface);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .testimonial-name {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .testimonial-role {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .cta-section {
      background: linear-gradient(150deg, #0d2341 0%, #1e4a7c 55%, #6cace3 100%);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .cta-section::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 30px 30px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .cta-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5rem 24px;
    }

    .cta-content h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .cta-content p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .cta-form {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .cta-form input {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 200px;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      color: #fff;
      outline: none;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .cta-form input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
    .cta-form input:focus { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

    .cta-form button {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--accent);
      border: none;
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      font-family: inherit;
    }
    .cta-form button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }

    .cta-note {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-top: 1rem !important;
    }

    .products-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .product-card {
      background: var(--bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }
    .product-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .product-image {
      aspect-ratio: 1/1;
      background: var(--surface);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .product-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .product-card h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 0.25rem;
    }

    .product-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent-secondary);
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    /* Section fade-in on scroll */
    .fade-section {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(16px);
      transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease;
    }
    .fade-section.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    /* Focus visible */
    :focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: 3px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .btn-landing-primary:focus-visible,
    .btn-landing-secondary:focus-visible,
    .cta-form button:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #fff;
      outline-offset: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .cta-form input:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--accent-secondary);
      outline-offset: 2px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .btn-landing-primary:active {
      transform: scale(0.97);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .btn-landing-secondary:active {
      transform: scale(0.97);
    }

    .cta-form button:active {
      transform: scale(0.97);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .benefit-card, .why-card, .testimonial-card {
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }

    .benefit-card:hover, .why-card:hover, .testimonial-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .sr-only {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0,0,0,0);
      white-space: nowrap;
      border: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .section-pad { padding: 3.5rem 0; }
      .hero-inner { flex-direction: column; padding: 5rem 24px 3rem; gap: 2rem; }
      .hero-image-frame { width: min(280px, 60vw); }
      .cta-content { padding: 3.5rem 24px; }
      .cta-form { flex-direction: column; }
      .cta-form input { min-width: 0; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 430px) {
      .benefits-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .products-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
      .btn-landing-primary:hover, .btn-landing-primary:active,
      .btn-landing-secondary:hover, .btn-landing-secondary:active,
      .product-card:hover,
      .benefit-card:hover, .why-card:hover, .testimonial-card:hover {
        transform: none;
      }
      .fade-section { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    }
  </style>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero-landing">
    <div class="hero-inner container">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow-landing">Instituciones educativas</span>
        <h1>Abastecimiento confiable para tu institución</h1>
        <p>Limpieza, papelería e insumos para escuelas, preparatorias y universidades. Cotiza en minutos y recibe en todo México.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#cotizar" class="btn-landing-primary">Solicitar cotización</a>
          <a href="#beneficios" class="btn-landing-secondary">Conoce más</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-image-frame">
        <img src="/assets/img/landings/negocios-educativos/hero-section.webp" alt="Instituciones educativas" width="380" height="380" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:var(--radius);object-fit:cover;">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BENEFICIOS -->
  <section class="section-pad fade-section" id="beneficios" style="background:var(--surface);">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Beneficios</span>
      <h2 class="section-title mx-auto" style="max-width:600px;">Todo lo que tu operación educativa necesita al instante</h2>
      <p class="section-desc mx-auto">Olvida las compras de último momento. Con Klyn tienes un proveedor único que entiende el ritmo y las exigencias del sector educativo.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="container benefits-grid">
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Entrega en 24–48 horas</h3>
        <p>Programa tus pedidos con la anticipación que necesites. Si algo urgente surge, ajustamos la entrega para que tu operación no se detenga.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20V10"/><path d="M18 20V4"/><path d="M6 20v-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Precios preferenciales para educación</h3>
        <p>Tarifas especiales para instituciones educativas con descuentos por volumen y programas de abastecimiento recurrente.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Catálogo completo en un solo lugar</h3>
        <p>Limpieza profesional, papelería, materiales de oficina y suministros especializados. Todo desde una misma plataforma, un solo pedido, una sola factura.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- POR QUÉ KLYN -->
  <section class="section-pad fade-section" id="por-que-klyn">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Por qué Klyn</span>
      <h2 class="section-title mx-auto" style="max-width:640px;">El proveedor que las instituciones educativas necesitan</h2>
      <p class="section-desc mx-auto">Sabemos que una escuela no puede darse el lujo de quedarse sin insumos. Por eso construimos un sistema de abastecimiento pensado en tus tiempos y volúmenes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="container why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Abastecimiento a gran escala</h3>
        <p>Capacidad para suministrar a planteles con cientos o miles de alumnos. Desde una preparatoria hasta un campus universitario completo.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Higiene y calidad garantizada</h3>
        <p>Productos de limpieza profesional con los más altos estándares. Ideales para mantener espacios escolares seguros e higiénicos.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Plataforma de pedidos digital</h3>
        <p>Cotiza desde tu escritorio o celular. Historial de pedidos, facturación automatizada y reorden con un clic para no perder tiempo.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s-8-4.5-8-11.8A8 8 0 0 1 12 2a8 8 0 0 1 8 8.2c0 7.3-8 11.8-8 11.8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Cobertura en todo México</h3>
        <p>Con presencia en Los Mochis y envíos a todo el país. Sin importar dónde esté tu institución, llegamos con los insumos que necesitas.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRODUCTOS -->
  <section class="section-pad fade-section" id="productos" style="background:var(--bg);">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Insumos institucionales</span>
      <h2 class="section-title mx-auto" style="max-width:640px;">Equipa tu institución con productos profesionales</h2>
      <p class="section-desc mx-auto">Limpieza, papelería, consumibles de impresión y más. Todo lo que una escuela necesita administrativa y operativamente, en un solo proveedor.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="container products-grid">
      <div class="product-card">
        <div class="product-image">
          <img src="/assets/img/landings/negocios-educativos/liquidos-quimicos.webp" alt="Líquidos y químicos profesionales" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <h3>Líquidos y químicos profesionales</h3>
        <p>Desinfectantes, limpiadores multiusos, desengrasantes, aromatizantes y solventes de grado institucional. Productos certificados, seguros para usar en entornos escolares.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <div class="product-image">
          <img src="/assets/img/landings/negocios-educativos/jerceria-herramientas.webp" alt="Herramientas y equipos de limpieza" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <h3>Herramientas y equipos</h3>
        <p>Trapeadores, escobas, cubetas, exprimidores, aspersores, carros de limpieza y dispensadores. Equipo resistente para uso continuo en instituciones de gran volumen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <div class="product-image">
          <img src="/assets/img/landings/negocios-educativos/suministros-papel.webp" alt="Suministros de papel e higiene" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <h3>Suministros de papel e higiene</h3>
        <p>Papel higiénico, toallas de papel, jabón de manos, gel antibacterial y dispensadores. Formato institucional con el mejor costo por uso para tu presupuesto.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <div class="product-image">
          <img src="/assets/img/landings/negocios-educativos/bolsas-desechables.webp" alt="Bolsas, desechables y accesorios" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <h3>Bolsas, desechables y accesorios</h3>
